Prior art / technique class for future Vibe Vision (1.1):
Random-dot kinematograms and motion-coherence illusions are a long-standing
perception technique. Eric Lu / Mixfont popularized a recent presentation of
this class for frontier-model testing. VCL VibeBench's Vibe Vision (when shipped)
will be an original implementation of the general technique — not a fork of any
third-party product, and never branded as "Ghost Font".
